Sample project for the CodeScan UI tests (its/src/test/kotlin/org/sonarlint/intellij/its/tests/CodeScanScenarioTests.kt,
ConnectedAnalysisTests.kt and CodeScanStagingTests.kt, which binds it to a project on a live CodeScan server).

The pom.xml only makes src/main/java a Java source folder.

Known issues with the analyzers bundled in the plugin (no server):
- src/main/java/sample/Greeter.java: 2 issues, java:S1481 (unused local variable "unused") and java:S106 (System.out).
  The scenario types "int typed = 0;" below the marker comment, which adds a second java:S1481: 3 issues.
- web/greeter.js: a sparse array ("Unexpected comma in middle of array."). JavaScript analysis needs Node.js.
- force-app/main/default/classes/GreeterService.cls: Apex. The plugin has no Apex analyzer of its own; Apex issues come
  only from a CodeScan server in connected mode (public field, System.debug). CodeScanStagingTests checks that at least
  one shows up.
